  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital | Blaine, MN\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Blaine, MN\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nBlaine, MN\nAfter-Hours Emergency\n763.754.9434\n11850 Aberdeen St. NE\nBlaine, MN 55449\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\nMon: 24 hours\nTue: 12 am-7 am; 4 pm-4 am\nWed: 4 pm-4 am\nThu: 12 pm-7 am\nFri: 12 pm-12 am\nSat & Sun: 24 hours\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Blaine – serving the northern suburbs of Minneapolis.\nWe are located in Blaine off Highway 65 and Cloud Drive and we serve the northern twin cities suburbs, including Andover, Anoka, Brooklyn Park, Champlin, Circle Pines, Coon Rapids, Ham Lake, Lino Lakes, Osseo, Maple Grove, and surrounding areas.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen you have a pet emergency, seconds count. We want you to know, your Blaine emergency pet hospital is ready. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nCall ahead to your BluePearl emergency vet and let us know you’re coming. No appointment is necessary for our emergency vet.\nLearn more about your emergency visit\n.\nSee Our Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Blaine.\nWe strive to match the quality and integrity of animal healthcare with that of human healthcare, and our hospital reflects that vision. At more than 8,000 square feet, our Blaine pet hospital is fully equipped with two surgical suites, ultrasound, endoscopy and an in-house laboratory.\nPet owners\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospitals, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n763.754.9434\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nTestimonials.\nThere isn’t a pet hospital better than BluePearl. Again, thank you to BluePearl for bringing my sweetie baby Joli back to me!” — Jeanette L.\nRead more of\nJeanette’s story\n.\nCurrent location.\n763.754.9434\n763.754.5731\n11850 Aberdeen St. NE\nBlaine,\nMN                                    55449\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nArden Hills, MN\n1285 Grey Fox Rd., Ste. 100\nArden Hills, MN 55112\n763.754.5000\n9.84 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nGolden Valley, MN\n760 Boone Ave N\nGolden Valley, MN 55427\n952.942.8272\n15.67 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nSt. Cloud, MN\n4180 Thielman Ln.\nSt. Cloud, MN 56301\n320.258.3481\n53.74 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
